# Extravagant Replication: "At the beginning of your upkeep, create a token that's a copy of another target nonland permanent you control" (CR 608.2b).
# In Bot1's turn-3 upkeep the trigger targets Memnite; Bot2 kills the Memnite with Lightning Bolt in response, so the trigger's only target is
# illegal on resolution: it does nothing and no token is created (not a copy of anything else).

